## Dynamically modulated synthesis of hollow metal-organic frameworks for selective hydrogenation reactions
Liyun Xiao<sup>1</sup>, Chuanq Cheng<sup>2</sup>, Zhixi Li<sup>1</sup>, Chaoyang Zheng<sup>1</sup>, Jing Du<sup>1</sup>, Meina Song<sup>1</sup>, Yue Wan<sup>1</sup>, Shaopeng Li<sup>1</sup>, Guo Jun<sup>3</sup>, and Meiting Zhao<sup>1</sup>(✉)
